<title>USA: GZA sets repurchase for up to 250,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>GZA sets repurchase for up to 250,000 shrs.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEWTON UPPER FALLS, Mass., , Aug 7 (Reuter) GZA GeoEnvironmental Technologies Inc said Thursday its board approved the repurchase of up to 250,000 shares.</p>
<p>The company said it may repurchase the shares based on prevailing market prices as it deems favorable in the open market.</p>
</text>
